### 医疗系统实验二接口测试（IDEA HTTP Client，点击左侧绿色箭头即可执行）
@host = http://localhost:8080
# 实验四令牌：先执行 31、32、33 三条登录（它们会把令牌写入下面的变量）
@adminToken = 
@doctorToken = 
@patientToken = 

### 1. 科室分页查询（第1页，每页5条）
GET {{host}}/api/departments?pageNum=1&pageSize=5

### 2. 科室按名称模糊查询
GET {{host}}/api/departments?name=内&status=1

### 3. 科室详情
GET {{host}}/api/departments/1

### 4. 新增科室
POST {{host}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deptCode": "KF",
  "deptName": "康复科",
  "location": "门诊楼6层",
  "phone": "0731-88880006",
  "description": "术后康复与理疗",
  "status": 1
}

### 5. 修改科室（把 id 换成刚新增的科室 id）
PUT {{host}}/api/departments/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deptCode": "KF",
  "deptName": "康复医学科",
  "location": "门诊楼6层东区",
  "phone": "0731-88880006",
  "status": 1
}

### 6. 删除科室（有医生引用时会返回 400 提示不能删除）
DELETE {{host}}/api/departments/6

### 7. 医生分页查询（按科室+关键词）
GET {{host}}/api/doctors?pageNum=1&pageSize=10&departmentId=1&keyword=张

### 8. 新增医生（departmentId 必须是已存在的科室）
POST {{host}}/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorNo": "D0006",
  "name": "吴磊",
  "gender": "男",
  "title": "主治医师",
  "departmentId": 2,
  "phone": "13800001006",
  "specialty": "骨折复位与关节镜",
  "status": 1
}

### 9. 患者分页查询（姓名模糊）
GET {{host}}/api/patients?pageNum=1&pageSize=10&keyword=刘

### 10. 新增患者（身份证号需校验位正确，出生日期会自动回填）
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientNo": "P0004",
  "name": "郑爽",
  "gender": "女",
  "idCard": "430102199608082347",
  "phone": "13900002004",
  "address": "长沙市雨花区"
}

### 11. 异常用例：手机号格式错误（预期 400）
POST {{host}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientNo": "P0005",
  "name": "测试患者",
  "gender": "男",
  "idCard": "430102199003031234",
  "phone": "12345678901"
}

### 12. 异常用例：科室编码重复（预期 400）
POST {{host}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deptCode": "NK",
  "deptName": "内科二诊室",
  "status": 1
}

### ===== 实验三：排班 / 挂号 / 处方（事务） =====

### 13. 排班分页查询（按医生筛选）
GET {{host}}/api/schedules?doctorId=1&pageNum=1&pageSize=5

### 14. 新增排班（同一医生同一天同一时段只能排一次，重复会返回 400）
POST {{host}}/api/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doctorId": 1,
  "scheduleDate": "2026-11-20",
  "timeSlot": "上午",
  "totalSlots": 8,
  "regFee": 20.00,
  "status": 1
}

### 15. 挂号（号源 booked_slots +1；重复挂号返回 400）
POST {{host}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 4,
  "scheduleId": 1
}

### 16. 挂号记录分页查询
GET {{host}}/api/registrations?patientId=4&pageNum=1&pageSize=5

### 17. 取消挂号（状态置 2 并释放号源）
PUT {{host}}/api/registrations/25/cancel

### 18. 开处方（处方、明细、库存扣减同一事务；数量超库存返回 400 且整单回滚）
POST {{host}}/api/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "registrationId": 25,
  "diagnosis": "急性咽炎",
  "items": [
    { "drugId": 1, "quantity": 2, "dosage": "一次2粒，一日3次" }
  ]
}

### 19. 处方分页查询
GET {{host}}/api/prescriptions?patientId=4&pageNum=1&pageSize=5

### 20. 处方明细
GET {{host}}/api/prescriptions/11/items

### 21. 药品库存查询
GET {{host}}/api/drugs?keyword=阿莫西林&pageNum=1&pageSize=5

### ============ 实验四：安全认证 ============

### 28. 管理员登录（后续请求用返回的 token）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "123456"}
> {%
  client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 29. 医生登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "doctor1", "password": "123456"}
> {%
  client.global.set("doctorToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 30. 患者登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "patient1", "password": "123456"}
> {%
  client.global.set("patientToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 31. 口令错误，返回 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "admin", "password": "000000"}

### 32. 未登录访问患者档案，返回 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients

### 33. 患者令牌访问患者档案，返回 403（RBAC 越权）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 34. 医生令牌查看患者档案，身份证与手机号脱敏
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/1
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### 35. 管理员令牌查看患者档案，返回完整敏感字段
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 36. 查询当前登录信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 37. 注销后旧令牌失效，返回 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### 38. 未登录查询科室目录（公开只读），返回 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/departments
